# ============================================================================
# REFERENCE / SCRATCH DIRECTORIES — this repo tracks only backend/ + frontend/
# (plus monitoring/, needed by docker-compose.yml's Prometheus/Grafana mounts).
# Everything below is either a standalone project with its own git remote, or
# design/reference/scratch material with no runtime dependency from the app.
# ============================================================================

# CTF-icode and ctf-worker-agent are independent GitHub repos (their own
# remotes: zakaishere/CTF-icode, zakaishere/ctf-worker-agent) that happen to
# be checked out inside this working tree. Never track a nested .git as a
# gitlink here — clone them separately wherever they're deployed.
CTF-icode/
icode-ctf/
ctf-worker-agent/

